        "sourceExample": "#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 7;\n    int values[7] = {7, -3, 0, 5, -3, 2, 9};\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i = i + 1) {\n        int minIndex = i;\n        for (int j = i + 1; j < n; j = j + 1) {\n            if (values[j] < values[minIndex]) {\n                minIndex = j;\n            }\n        }\n        if (minIndex != i) {\n            int temp = values[i];\n            values[i] = values[minIndex];\n            values[minIndex] = temp;\n        }\n    }\n    for (int k = 0; k < n; k = k + 1) {\n        if (k > 0) {\n            printf(\" \");\n        }\n        printf(\"%d\", values[k]);\n    }\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
